  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Finely chop garlic.\n• Cut Japanese tofu into 1cm cubes.\n• Grate carrot.\n• Thinly slice pear.\n• In a medium bowl, combine shredded cabbage mix and garlic aioli. Season to taste. Set aside. TIP: Prepping the slaw first allows the cabbage to soften slightly by the time you're ready to serve.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-665597afa8b29b0c10df4535-09196365.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a small bowl, combine garlic, the honey, katsu paste, mixed sesame seeds and a dash of water. Set aside.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-665597afa8b29b0c10df4535-a4b37c55.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Cook tofu, turning often, until browned, 2-4 minutes. Cook tofu in batches for the best result.\n• Add katsu mixture and cook, turning tofu to coat, until slightly sticky, 1-2 minutes.\n• Microwave mini flourtortillas on a plate in 10 second bursts, until warmed through.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-665597afa8b29b0c10df4535-03d2ed5d.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Finely slice long chilli (if using).\n• Fill tortillas with creamy slaw, pear, carrot and katsu glazed tofu.\n• Sprinkle with chilli and crispy shallots to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-665597afa8b29b0c10df4535-9caea891.jpeg"
    }
  ]
